TraceGuard Research Artifact

This repository is a clean public research implementation created to accompany
"Trace-Reconstruction Attacks and Trace-Private Defenses for Confidential LLM
Agents." It does not include the surrounding workspace's proprietary or
commercial TraceGuard product code.

The synthetic medical corpus in src/traceguard/data/synthetic-medical-v1.json
is released under CC0-1.0. It was authored for this artifact and contains no
real patient data.

Third-party Python packages are installed from their upstream distributions and
retain their own licenses. They are not vendored in this repository. See
THIRD_PARTY.md and the dependency lock for the exact set used by a run.

The paper checkout does not identify its authors or copyright owner. Those
fields must be supplied by the publisher before a public release; this artifact
does not invent them.

